columns: 0-delta = display frames in the steady window with no motion; 2+ = frames that got more than one delta; CV = coefficient of variation of the per-frame delta; total/truth = scrolled vs finger motion; landing = how far past the true stop the shown position froze; carried = total − truth, the gesture-local offset forgotten at lift; deadzone = finger motion before the shown position moved again after the stop-and-resume (0 by construction); latency = mean true-sample-time → vsync-at-which-it-is-shown; max err = worst shown-vs-finger position error while moving (ON: against the finger `latency` earlier; OFF: plain lag).
inputs: clean = 10 ms cadence, 1 ms delivery; LH jitter = timestamps ±2 ms, 1 ms delivery; BLE batch = honest timestamps, 15 ms batches.
assertions: no retraction posted in any ON run; dead zone on resume 0 in every ON run.
